  "nameEn": "The Grand Route",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Walk the spiral to the centre: on each side move to an obstacle and turn right. Repair a sparking lamp and light it, light any other lamp, and on free tiles pick up whatever lies there.",
  "descriptionEn": "The summary of the section: a big spiral of 31 steps. Everything you can do — \"While\", a loop, a chain of conditions and collecting items — works in one short program.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Walk the spiral to the centre: on each side move to an obstacle and turn right. Only repair a sparking lamp, turn off a shining one, leave lamps without bulbs alone, and on free tiles pick up whatever lies there."
